  <div class="field--entity-reference-revisions">



<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout-paragraph paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--id--820374">
  <div class="paragraph__column">       <div class="layout layout--twocol-section layout--twocol-section--67-33 row">
          <div  class="layout__region--first col-12 col-md-8 pe-md-1">
        



<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--id--820375">
  <div class="paragraph__column">     
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="tex2jax_process"><h2>Technology</h2><p>Innovations in artificial intelligence, climate models, and cloud computing are improving the ways users work with Earth science data, especially massive datasets like those expected from NISAR. NASA leverages modern computing approaches to optimize the quality of data collected and the speed at which users are able to drill down to the details they need to support on-the-ground science.</p></div></div>
      
  </div>
</div>

      </div>
    
          <div  class="layout__region--second col-12 col-md-4 ps-md-1">
        
      </div>
      </div>



  </div>
</div>
</div>
  <div class="field--entity-reference-revisions">



<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout-paragraph paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--id--820376">
  <div class="paragraph__column">       <div class="layout layout--twocol-section layout--twocol-section--50-50 row">
          <div  class="layout__region--first col-12 col-md-8 pe-md-1">
        



<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--image-second-column-width paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--id--820377">
  <div class="paragraph__column">     <div  class="_none"><div  class="container">  
  <div  class="layout row no-gutters layout-builder__layout">
    
                        <div  class="col-12">
          <div class="_none block block-layout-builder block-field-blockparagraphimage-second-column-widthfield-image-second-column-width">
  
    
      <div class="content">
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-image-second-column-width field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div>
  
  
  <div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden">
    <div class="field__label visually-hidden">Image</div>
              <div class="field__item">
<a href="https://earthdata.nasa.gov/s3fs-public/2025-12/cloud-computing.jpg?VersionId=WE_HfTHx1reowRfLr9nJUqz6929GTZyi" aria-label="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Cloud Computing&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;cloud on top of circuit board&quot;}" role="button"  title="" data-colorbox-gallery="" class="colorbox" aria-controls="colorbox-1E9VoUP2Z38" data-cbox-img-attrs="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Cloud Computing&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;cloud on top of circuit board&quot;}"><img id="colorbox-1E9VoUP2Z38" src="https://earthdata.nasa.gov/s3fs-public/styles/hds_two_column/public/2025-12/cloud-computing.jpg?VersionId=OvP8tYmo18gHaG9pfwQQm1PjCDWY9Hj6&amp;itok=iuLMQjSs" width="750" height="563" alt="cloud on top of circuit board" title="Cloud Computing" loading="lazy" class="image-style-hds-two-column img-fluid" />

</a>
