<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--id--1339343">
  <div class="paragraph__column">     
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="tex2jax_process"><h3>Earth Observation Data and Artificial Intelligence</h3><p>The application of artificial intelligence (AI) to Earth science data makes it possible to search through large amounts of data to find relationships.</p></div></div>
      
  </div>
</div>




